WEBVTT

00:07:29.778 --> 00:07:32.781
is that it's beyond
standard-model physics.

00:07:33.574 --> 00:07:36.660
It's not like any of the particles
that we have ever seen

00:07:36.702 --> 00:07:38.829
or had any kind of contact with.

00:07:40.581 --> 00:07:43.542
Alright, so this seems
like a potentially terrifying,

00:07:43.584 --> 00:07:45.336
intractable problem,

00:07:45.336 --> 00:07:48.005
because we're talking
about something that we can't see,

00:07:48.047 --> 00:07:49.632
something that we can't touch.

00:07:50.007 --> 00:07:51.217
You might be thinking,

00:07:51.258 --> 00:07:54.053
"OK, they haven't had many ideas
about that over the years,

00:07:54.094 --> 00:07:56.013
because that just seems really hard."

00:07:56.347 --> 00:07:57.473
Right?

00:07:58.265 --> 00:08:01.310
So here's the Venn diagram
to end all Venn diagrams.